  "sha": "9438850261b742093dd2497ccf898159d3235a9d5a35ff987fe2c56cc78553dc",
  "message": "fix: resolve refs for commit diff and read every status for commit status\n\ngt commit diff failed for tags with dots and branches with slashes: the\ndiff route reads the dot as its extension. The ref is resolved to its SHA\nfirst.\n\ngt commit status read the combined status, which covers only the first\npage of contexts, so a failure further back still exited 0. It now reads\nevery status and shares its output and exit status with gt pr checks.\n",
